  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d21438f07bf2e8446b0a1da7bf64f675, type: 3}
  m_Name: Day2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dayNumber: 2
  storyText: "Last night was endless screaming. By dawn, everything went eerily quiet.
    Blue sky, sunny, beautiful \u2014 totally wrong for the blood stains on the courtyard.
    The ducks are still waddling around looking for worms. Zombies don't care about
    ducks, apparently. Lucky ducks. Power's still on. Social media is exploding \u2014
    half the people are joking about no more work or school, the other half are crying.
    The army posted an announcement: hide, stay quiet, run if you see zombies, save
    food. They'll find a solution. We're supposed to feel better now. We don't.\r\n\r\n"
